+<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div class="reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Learning with care</div><h2>Room to learn at their own pace.</h2><p class="body-copy">Our volunteer teachers support children as they build a strong foundation in Qur’an recitation, Arabic reading, and Islamic studies. Special attention is given to helping English-speaking students practice proper pronunciation step by step.</p><p class="body-copy">Classes are intentionally small — typically 6 to 18 students — so teachers can provide individual attention and encouragement.</p><a class="btn btn-dark" href="visit.html">Ask about registration <svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div><div class="surface-panel glass--frosted reveal delay-1"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-book"/></svg><h3>Learn. Practice. Belong.</h3><p>We want children to build confidence, develop Islamic character, and form a meaningful connection with their faith, community, and the Book of Allah.</p><div class="check-list"><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Qur’an recitation</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Arabic reading</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Islamic studies</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Small classes</span></div></div></div></section>
