+<section class="section"><div class="wrap faq"><div class="eyebrow">Good to know</div><h2>Questions from families.</h2><details><summary>How do I register my child?</summary><p>Email <a href="mailto:jafferycenter@gmail.com?subject=Sunday%20School%20Inquiry">jafferycenter@gmail.com</a> to ask about registration, availability, and the current schedule.</p></details><details><summary>How big are the classes?</summary><p>Classes are typically 6 to 18 students, allowing volunteer teachers to give children individual attention.</p></details><details><summary>Does my child need to know Arabic already?</summary><p>Classes focus on helping English-speaking students build a foundation in Arabic reading and Qur’an pronunciation. Email the center to discuss your child’s needs.</p></details><details><summary>How can we practice at home?</summary><p>Regular short review sessions can help children build confidence over time. Ask the teachers what your child is currently learning so you can practice together.</p></details></div></section>
